{"3647730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Laserboy VR: Champions", "steam_appid": 3647730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LASERBOY VR: CHAMPIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647730/extras/b0eb987ca726fc11880b11539c08d66b.avif?t=1788022842\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647730/extras_big/b0eb987ca726fc11880b11539c08d66b.webp?t=1788022842 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The next evolution of Laserboy VR.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the arena and compete in fast-paced competitive action shooter built for the next generation of VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LASERBOY VR: CHAMPIONS</strong> is an arcade-style multiplayer shooter where every match is easy to learn, quick to jump into, and endlessly replayable. Grab your headset, join a match, and start blasting within seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight across vibrant futuristic arenas, master unique power-ups, unlock new gear, and climb the ranks as you become the ultimate Champion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Built for Steam Frame</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LASERBOY VR: CHAMPIONS is being developed with Steam Frame in mind, bringing instant pickup-and-play VR action to a new generation of players. We also plan to bring this to PC and other VR platforms!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Please Note: Everything is subject to change. Game is currently in Development.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community feedback will directly shape the future of Laserboy VR: Champions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you in the arena!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LASERBOY VR: CHAMPIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647730/extras/b0eb987ca726fc11880b11539c08d66b.avif?t=1788022842\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647730/extras_big/b0eb987ca726fc11880b11539c08d66b.webp?t=1788022842 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The next evolution of Laserboy VR.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the arena and compete in fast-paced competitive action shooter built for the next generation of VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LASERBOY VR: CHAMPIONS</strong> is an arcade-style multiplayer shooter where every match is easy to learn, quick to jump into, and endlessly replayable. Grab your headset, join a match, and start blasting within seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight across vibrant futuristic arenas, master unique power-ups, unlock new gear, and climb the ranks as you become the ultimate Champion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Built for Steam Frame</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LASERBOY VR: CHAMPIONS is being developed with Steam Frame in mind, bringing instant pickup-and-play VR action to a new generation of players. We also plan to bring this to PC and other VR platforms!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Please Note: Everything is subject to change. Game is currently in Development.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community feedback will directly shape the future of Laserboy VR: Champions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you in the arena!</p>", "short_description": "LASERBOY VR: CHAMPIONS is a fast-paced competitive action shooter. Team up, lock in, and battle through neon arenas where quick reflexes, smart plays, and map control separate Champions from everyone else. Easy to jump in. Impossible to put down.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647730/938ba0385f